{
  "_comment": "Hearthbound (End Remastered eye coverage): widens minecraft:has_structure/pillager_outpost, which gates endrem:corrupted_eye. Towns & Towers ships this tag with \"replace\": true and the single value minecraft:plains, cutting vanilla's seven entries (desert, plains, savanna, snowy_plains, taiga, grove, #minecraft:is_mountain) down to one and deleting RU's 12 and BWG's 11. T&T does that because it adds ~24 biome-themed outpost variants of its own -- but those variants are keyed on the DEAD byg: namespace (BWG 1.8.0 is biomeswevegone:) and on RU's pre-0.5.6 names, so they cover almost no modded biome either. Luki's Grand Capitals owns the minecraft:pillager_outpost structure in this pack, so vanilla's biome list is restored here and widened to the same five families in RU and BWG. endrem:corrupted_eye has no other source at all. replace:false merges on top of whatever the jars ended up with, and this datapack loads after mod jars, so it also lands on top of a mod's replace:true. Regenerate with .claude/tools/gen-endrem-eye-coverage.js; measure with .claude/tools/endrem-eye-audit.js.",
